{
  "id": "prologue",
  "kind": "prologue",
  "label": "Prologue",
  "title": "The Quiet I Started Living With",
  "shortTitle": "Prologue",
  "file": "chapters/06-prologue.json",
  "index": 6,
  "sourceRange": [
    98,
    200
  ],
  "elements": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "There is a moment in every life that almost no one remembers."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 100
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not because it is dramatic."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 101
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But because nothing seems to happen."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 102
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "No tragedy announces it."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 103
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "No celebration marks it."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 104
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "The world continues unchanged."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 105
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Morning still arrives on time."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 106
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Messages still get read."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 107
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "People still ask how you are—and you still answer automatically."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 108
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "From the outside, nothing shifts."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 109
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But somewhere beneath that continuity, something quietly turns inward."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 110
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not the body."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 111
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not the circumstances."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 112
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But attention itself."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 113
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Without noticing, you begin spending more time inside your mind than inside your life."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 114
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "At first, it looks harmless."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 115
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "You replay a conversation from earlier in the day."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 116
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "You recheck a tone, a pause, a word you shouldn’t have said."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 117
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "You imagine alternative endings to things that already ended."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 118
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It feels ordinary. Almost responsible. Like understanding."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 119
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Everyone does it."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 120
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But the mind does not treat repetition neutrally."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 121
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It rewards it."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 122
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And what is rewarded is returned to."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 123
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Again."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 124
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And again."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 125
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Until what was once a passing thought becomes a familiar place."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 126
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And familiarity slowly changes its meaning."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 127
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It starts convincing you that repetition is clarity."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 128
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "That revisiting something is the same as understanding it."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 129
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "That was the illusion I never questioned."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 130
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "I believed I was remembering my life."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 131
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "In truth, I was reconstructing it—each time slightly differently."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 132
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A memory belongs to what happened."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 133
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But interpretation survives in the present."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 134
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It adjusts itself quietly—according to fear, regret, pride, and expectation."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 135
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Until eventually, you are no longer carrying the event itself."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 136
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "You are carrying the version of it your mind refused to stop editing."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 137
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "There was a night I remember clearly—not because it was important, but because it wasn’t."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 138
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "I was sitting in my room, lights off, phone face down, replaying a conversation that had ended hours ago. Nothing had gone wrong in any visible sense. And yet my mind kept trying to “fix” what could no longer be changed."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 139
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "That was when I first noticed something strange."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 140
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "The silence around me was not silent at all."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 141
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It was filled."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 142
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not with sound—but with commentary."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 143
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Questions without answers."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 144
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Replies I should have given."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 145
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Explanations no one had asked for."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 146
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "I used to think silence was outside me."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 147
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "An empty room."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 148
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A late-night street."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 149
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A paused world."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 150
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "I was wrong."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 151
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "The loudest place I had ever been was inside my own head."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 152
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And it wasn’t trying to harm me."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 153
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It was trying to resolve uncertainty."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 154
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Because uncertainty feels unfinished."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 155
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And the mind prefers a painful explanation over no explanation at all."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 156
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "So it keeps building stories."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 157
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not because it wants suffering—but because it cannot tolerate gaps."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 158
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "What is unfinished becomes replayed."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 159
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "What is replayed becomes familiar."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 160
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "What is familiar becomes identity."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 161
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "That is how quietly it happens."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 162
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "You don’t notice the transition."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 163
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "One day you are thinking."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 164
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And one day you are being thought through."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 165
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "For years, I mistook this for awareness."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 166
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But awareness expands life."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 167
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "This only refined my inner patterns."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 168
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "There is a kind of comfort hidden inside mental noise."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 169
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not because it feels good—but because it is predictable."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 170
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And predictable pain often feels safer than unfamiliar peace."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 171
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "I did not realize I was choosing familiarity over experience."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 172
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Every day."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 173
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Without deciding."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 174
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Without resistance."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 175
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "This is not a story about something that broke."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 176
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It is about something that slowly replaced everything else."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 177
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Presence replaced by interpretation."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 178
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Living replaced by replaying."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 179
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Experience replaced by explanation."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 180
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And the gap between them never felt like a gap."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 181
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It felt like thinking."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 182
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "This book is not an attempt to define silence."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 183
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Silence does not need interpretation."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 184
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It is an attempt to observe what happens when a person becomes more fluent in their thoughts than in their own life."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 185
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "When explanation becomes easier than experience."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 186
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "When surviving thoughts becomes so normal that living quietly stops feeling necessary."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 187
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "If these pages resemble you in any way, do not rush to find conclusions."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 188
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Conclusions end movement."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 189
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And this story is not meant to end anything."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 190
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Only to notice what has been happening for a long time without being noticed."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 191
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Perhaps silence was never the absence of sound."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 192
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Perhaps it was the gradual disappearance of the person who once experienced life before translating it."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 193
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And perhaps that is why it was so difficult to recognize."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 194
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Silence did not arrive."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 195
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It was learned."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 196
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Slowly."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 197
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And eventually… it was lived."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 198
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And maybe that is where the story actually begins."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 199
    }
  ],
